    ]
   ],
   "s": "Twenty-two pieces of Belgium sit inside the Netherlands here, and 8 pieces of the Netherlands sit inside those, or inside Belgium proper. The smallest Belgian parcel, H7, is 2,469 square metres. Wikipedia's parcel table has the border running through about 54 homes; in H7 it splits a front door, which has one Belgian and one Dutch house number. Natural Earth draws none of this: at 1:10 million Baarle is just the Netherlands."
  },
  {
