    ]
   ],
   "s": "This river island in the Bidasoa, 6,820 square metres in the condominium table, belongs to both France and Spain. France runs it from 1 August to 31 January, Spain from 1 February to 31 July. Louis XIV met his bride here, the Treaty of the Pyrenees was signed here, and there are no pheasants."
